Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.50,0:00:26.00,Default,,0,0,8,,{\blur3}《福尔摩斯历险记》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.50,0:01:55.00,Default,,0,0,8,,{\blur3}《孤身骑车人》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.53,0:02:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 华生 - 干嘛？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Watson. - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.03,0:02:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.04,0:02:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你即将目睹的化学反应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The chemical reaction you are about to witness{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.24,0:02:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会解决约翰·文森特·哈登先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will solve the mystery concerning the persecution{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.25,0:02:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}的迫害事件中的疑点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of Mr. John Vincent Harden.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.55,0:02:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excellent,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.97,0:03:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那位烟草富翁 我该记笔记吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the tobacco millionaire, shall I take notes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.97,0:03:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不用 时间宽裕之时我会复述\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I will dictate in the fullness of time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.98,0:03:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有位年轻女士想见你 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a young lady wishes to see you, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.86,0:03:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我现在不方便见客\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is not a convenient moment!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.90,0:03:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她是位谈吐得体 货真价实的淑女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's very well spoken, a genuine lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.87,0:03:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}毫无疑问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No doubt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.61,0:03:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并且坚持不懈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And persistent, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.99,0:03:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赫德森太太 我也是个坚持不懈的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs. Hudson, I, too, am extremely persistent,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.58,0:03:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尤其在工作的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}especially when I'm working.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.33,0:03:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是紧急事件 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is a matter of great urgency, Mr. Holmes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.54,0:03:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}否则我也不会在星期六晚上打扰你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or I would not be troubling you on a Saturday evening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.71,0:03:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或许你该\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps you could, uh,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.00,0:03:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}稍后再做化学反应 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}delay your chemical reaction, Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.80,0:03:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.60,0:03:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请坐 怎么称呼？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do sit down, Miss, uh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.27,0:03:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}维尔莉特·史密斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Violet Smith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.77,0:03:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.11,0:03:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 赫德森太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you Mrs. Hudson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.61,0:04:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正如我说 一位货真价实的淑女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A genuine lady, I told you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.36,0:04:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢 请坐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.62,0:04:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}呃 谢谢 我坐那里就可以了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um, thank you, I'll be quite happy here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.16,0:04:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了 史密斯小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very well, Miss Smith,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.13,0:04:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你得将你的紧急事件告诉我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you must tell us your matter of great urgency.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.79,0:04:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这肯定与你的健康无关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is obviously not your health.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.71,0:04:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你热衷于骑车 所以肯定充满活力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So ardent a bicyclist must be full of energy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.18,0:04:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我经常骑自行车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I bicycle a good deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.09,0:04:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}鞋底边缘的轻微起毛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Slight roughening on the side of the soles{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.01,0:04:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是与踏板摩擦造成的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}caused by the friction of the pedals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.60,0:04:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}棒极了 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excellent, Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.68,0:04:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你鞋子上的痕迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The marks on your shoes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.83,0:04:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.40,0:04:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即便是去很远的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even if I have to travel a long way,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.38,0:04:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也会像今天一样将单车带上火车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I take my bicycle on the train with me as I did today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.97,0:04:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请原谅 但这是我的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will excuse me, but it is my business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.70,0:04:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}果然 我差点犯了个错误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I nearly fell into the error{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.94,0:04:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以为你是靠打字维生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of supposing you earned a living by typewriting,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.50,0:04:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但很明显你靠音乐维生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but of course, it is obviously music.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.54,0:04:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生 看看勺状的指尖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will observe, Watson, the spatulate finger ends,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.83,0:05:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都是两种职业常见的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which is common to both professions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.50,0:05:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但她脸上有股灵性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is a spirituality about the face, however,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.42,0:05:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}打字员所不具备的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which the typewriter does not generate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.51,0:05:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这位女士是音乐家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This lady is a musician.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.05,0:05:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 福尔摩斯先生 我教音乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why, yes, Mr. Holmes, I teach music!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.39,0:05:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从你的脸色推测 你是在乡村教\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the country, I presume, from your complexion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.69,0:05:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在法恩罕附近 萨里的边界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Near Farnham on the borders of Surrey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.53,0:05:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请容我解释拜访的原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But please, let me explain why I am here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.70,0:05:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是独女 父亲在几年前去世了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am an only child, and my father died some years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.58,0:05:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的名字和职业？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His name and profession?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.88,0:05:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}詹姆斯·史密斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James Smith,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.17,0:05:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是旧皇家音乐厅的乐队指挥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he conducted the orchestra at the old Imperial Theater.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.38,0:05:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 旧音乐厅 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, the old Imperial, Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.92,0:05:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.47,0:05:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请继续\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please continue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.89,0:05:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我和母亲举目无亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My mother and I were left without a relation in the world{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.52,0:06:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只有一个叔叔 拉夫·史密斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}except for one uncle, Ralph Smith,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.23,0:06:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}15年前去了非洲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who went to Africa 15 years ago,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.65,0:06:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}之后便杳无音信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we have not had a word from him since,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.69,0:06:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尽管我们寄过圣诞卡和照片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}despite our Christmas cards and photographs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.48,0:06:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生 我得告诉你…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Holmes, I have to tell you that...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.08,0:06:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我猜你想告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you wish to tell me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.75,0:06:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你和你母亲一贫如洗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that you and your mother are very poor,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.62,0:06:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}却无法掩盖你的优雅 端庄和才华\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not withstanding your obvious grace, dignity and talent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.71,0:06:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们曾经很穷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were very poor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.71,0:06:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.09,0:06:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大约4个月前 在二月份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About four months ago, in February,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.56,0:06:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们得知《泰晤士报》上有则寻人启事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we were told there was an advertisement in the Times,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.97,0:06:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}询问我们的下落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}inquiring for our whereabouts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.94,0:06:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你能想象我们有多激动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can imagine how excited we were,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.10,0:06:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以为有人给我们留了笔财产\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for we thought that someone had left us a fortune.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.94,0:06:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我立即去找了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I went at once to the lawyers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.73,0:06:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}报上所登的律师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}whose name was given in the paper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.74,0:06:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这位是维尔莉特·史密斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, this is Miss Violet Smith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.49,0:06:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}律师给我引见了两位先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The solicitor introduced me to two men,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.12,0:07:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卡拉瑟斯先生和伍德利先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a Mr. Carruthers and a Mr. Woodley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.50,0:07:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们自南非回来拜访\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were on a visit from South Africa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.55,0:07:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我希望能告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish I could tell you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.85,0:07:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你叔叔给你留下一大笔遗产\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your uncle left you a vast fortune,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.27,0:07:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但正如我所说…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but as I said...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.31,0:07:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他死时贫困交加\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He died in extreme poverty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.60,0:07:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然而 我不是空手而来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}However, I myself am not without means.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.36,0:07:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我和母亲从未寻求施舍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My mother and I never sought charity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.24,0:07:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 我不是想施舍你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, nor do I offer it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.29,0:07:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请坐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.50,0:07:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想问你一个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a question to ask of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.13,0:07:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你叔叔拉夫说你喜爱音乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your Uncle Ralph said you were very musical,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.17,0:07:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你教音乐吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you teach music?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.34,0:07:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.97,0:07:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}史密斯小姐 我是鳏夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss Smith, I am now a widower{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.33,0:07:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有个10岁的女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with a 10-year-old daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.11,0:08:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小莎拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Young Sarah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.19,0:08:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她需要位音乐老师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She needs a music teacher.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.36,0:08:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此 我不是来施舍你们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, you see, I do not offer charity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.73,0:08:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}工作 他想给你份工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A job, he wants to give you a job!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.70,0:08:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你住在伦敦的哪里 卡拉瑟斯先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whereabouts in London do you live, Mr. Carruthers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.37,0:08:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不住伦敦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.62,0:08:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我住在离法恩罕约6英里的萨里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I live about six miles from Farnham, in Surrey,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.04,0:08:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}的奇尔顿农庄里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at Chiltern Grange.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.17,0:08:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不能让母亲独居\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I couldn't possibly leave my mother on her own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.71,0:08:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我每年付你100镑薪水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will pay you 100 pounds a year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.14,0:08:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每年100镑？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A hundred a year?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.85,0:08:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.06,0:08:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想大约是市价的两倍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Approximately double the market price, I think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.56,0:08:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢 不止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, at least!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.31,0:08:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你接受了 否则现在你不会在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which you obviously accepted, or you wouldn't be here now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.44,0:08:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.57,0:08:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我接受了这份工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I accepted the offer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.49,0:08:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卡拉瑟斯先生同意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Carruthers agreed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.16,0:08:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我每逢周末回城探望母亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I should go home every weekend to my mother in town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.03,0:08:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那现在是你回伦敦的周末之一？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So this is one of your weekend visits to London?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.41,0:09:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.25,0:09:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谈谈你在奇尔顿农庄的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me about your life at Chiltern Grange.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.58,0:09:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}刚开始 一切都很完美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For a while, it was quite perfect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.22,0:09:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每个星期一早晨我搭火车到法恩罕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every Monday morning I would take the train to Farnham{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.26,0:09:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后从车站骑车到农庄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then bicycle from the station to the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.74,0:09:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小女孩名叫莎拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The little girl's name was Sarah,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.16,0:09:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她让人非常愉快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and she was delightful,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.17,0:09:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也是位好学生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as well as being a very good pupil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.51,0:09:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有很大进步 莎拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was very much better, Sarah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.92,0:09:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我能再弹一次吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I try it again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.72,0:10:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然 我们坐在这正是为了如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course, that's why we're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.81,0:10:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卡拉瑟斯先生对我的工作很满意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Carruthers was appreciative of my work,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.81,0:10:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且是位友好周到的主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and an extremely kind and considerate host.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.44,0:10:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听起来很美好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sounds idyllic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.53,0:10:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.32,0:10:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是什么破坏了这份美好？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened to spoil it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.99,0:10:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一位访客\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A visitor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.79,0:10:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伍德利先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Woodley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.87,0:10:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么猜到的 福尔摩斯先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}However did you guess, Mr. Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.58,0:10:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}史密斯小姐 我从不猜测\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss Smith, I never guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.59,0:10:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谈谈他的来访\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me about his visit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.51,0:10:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他过来呆一个星期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He arrived and was to stay for a week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.18,0:10:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对我来说如同三秋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But to me it seemed like three months.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.64,0:10:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那可恨的红胡子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, that odious red mustache!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.57,0:11:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一天晚饭后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One evening after dinner,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.99,0:11:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卡拉瑟斯先生要离席片刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Carruthers had to leave us for a minute{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.20,0:11:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去门外见一位访客\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to see somebody at the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.04,0:11:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有位绅士想见你 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A gentleman to see you, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.17,0:11:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}失陪一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you excuse me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.46,0:12:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这下可好多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.30,0:12:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么好多了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Better, in what way?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.56,0:12:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有老头在这碍手碍脚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's better to get the old folk out of the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.90,0:12:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不认为卡拉瑟斯先生老\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't regard Mr. Carruthers as old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.27,0:12:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊 但也不如我俩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yes, but he isn't young...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.57,0:12:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那般年轻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}like us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.36,0:12:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我希望你别对着我喷烟 伍德利先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do wish you wouldn't blow smoke in my face, Mr. Woodley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.11,0:12:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可不信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I don't believe that for a moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.04,0:12:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不信什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What don't you believe?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.83,0:12:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当女人说不希望你做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When women say they wish you wouldn't do something,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.83,0:12:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她们通常表里不一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it generally means the exact opposite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.29,0:12:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没有表里不一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean precisely what I say!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.05,0:12:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伍德利先生 你能不能别烦我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Woodley, will you please leave me alone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.84,0:12:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.13,0:12:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}实话和你说 我会烦着你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To tell you the truth, I won't leave you alone,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.72,0:12:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}直到我说出真心话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not until I've said what's in my heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.56,0:12:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么意思？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.97,0:12:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不懂繁文缛节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not very well up on the social graces,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.98,0:12:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我愿意学 只要你愿意教我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I'm prepared to learn, if you're prepared to teach me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.94,0:13:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这真荒谬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, this is absurd!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.90,0:13:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一点也不荒谬 我在跟你求婚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It isn't absurd! I'm asking you to marry me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.57,0:13:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是诚心诚意的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean it, it's from the heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.45,0:13:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}钱不是问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Money isn't a problem,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.87,0:13:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在南非混得很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did very well out in South Africa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.70,0:13:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可以给你更好的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever you are accustomed to, I can give you better,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.37,0:13:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比你现在的要好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}better that you're accustomed to, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.33,0:13:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}珠宝 钻石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}jewelry, diamonds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.84,0:13:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你想要钻石 我可以给你钻石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want diamonds, oh, I can give you diamonds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.68,0:13:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不要钻石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want diamonds!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.80,0:13:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好好考虑一下 我不会催你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you think about it. I won't rush you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.27,0:13:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已经考虑过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've thought about it,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.98,0:13:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个想法太可笑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the idea is ludicrous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.31,0:13:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不能责怪我的争取\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you can't blame me for trying!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.69,0:13:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你非常美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're very beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.40,0:13:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为了消除芥蒂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, just to show there are no hard feelings,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.74,0:13:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我亲一下吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what about a little kiss to be going on with, hmm,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.33,0:13:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就在脸颊轻吻一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just a peck on the cheek.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.90,0:13:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伍德利先生 请你住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Woodley, will you please stop it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.67,0:13:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我说过女人表里不一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I told you before about women who say stop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.67,0:13:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.37,0:14:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}越挣扎 越有趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The more they struggle, the more fun it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.59,0:14:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卡拉瑟斯先生 让他住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Carruthers, will you stop him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.26,0:14:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}滚出我家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of this house!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.22,0:14:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.89,0:14:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.85,0:14:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我对老头可没有兴趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not interested in old men,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.70,0:14:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有老处女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and old maids!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.07,0:14:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我对刚刚发生的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can only offer you my most sincere apologies{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.30,0:14:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}表示深深的歉意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for what has happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.34,0:14:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我向你保证这种事再不会发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I give you my assurance that it will not happen again,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.64,0:14:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你能为了我女儿留下来吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for my daughter's sake, will you stay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.02,0:15:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我会留下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I will stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.65,0:15:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 维尔莉特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Violet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.08,0:15:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}自此之后我再没见过伍德利先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Woodley left the house and I have not seen him since.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.50,0:15:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无赖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The blackguard!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.47,0:15:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卡拉瑟斯先生的举止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Has there been any change{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.14,0:15:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有什么改变吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the behavior of Mr. Carruthers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.14,0:15:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有 他一如既往 周到而彬彬有礼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, he continues to be polite and considerate and courteous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.69,0:15:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}史密斯小姐 请继续说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, Miss Smith, please, please continue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.90,0:15:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}的确 还有一件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, there is something else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.87,0:15:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许是我多心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, it may be a mere fancy of mine,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.33,0:16:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但似乎卡拉瑟斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it seems to me that Mr. Carruthers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.29,0:16:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对我有意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}shows a great deal of interest in me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.42,0:16:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他什么也没说 他是位很好的绅士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, he has never said anything, he is a perfect gentleman,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.55,0:16:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但一个姑娘心里总明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but, a girl always knows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.84,0:16:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I believe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.39,0:16:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而我推定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I assume{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.18,0:16:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你对此没有予以任何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that these feelings that you sense from Mr. Carruthers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.68,0:16:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}感情上的回报吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are not reciprocated?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.17,0:16:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是位友好慷慨的雇主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is a kind and generous employer,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.36,0:16:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我已经订婚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I am already engaged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.56,0:16:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这位幸运的男士是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, the name of this very fortunate young man is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.57,0:16:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}西里尔·莫尔顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cyril Morton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.03,0:16:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是位电气工程师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's an electrical engineer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.04,0:16:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在考文垂的米德兰电气公司工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with the Midland Electric Company in Coventry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.87,0:16:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们要在夏末结婚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're to be married at the end of the summer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.00,0:16:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}祝你幸福\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We wish you joy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.21,0:16:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.01,0:16:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然而我很困惑你为什么会来找我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yet, I am puzzled as to why you have chosen to consult me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.38,0:16:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说的事的确引人入胜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is an intriguing story, to be sure,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.18,0:17:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我感觉到你的恐惧 却不知其因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I sense you are frightened, and do not understand why.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.27,0:17:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你看来有足够的自我保护能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You seem well capable of protecting yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.81,0:17:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}求求你 帮帮我 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, help me, Mr. Holmes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.24,0:17:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.74,0:17:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我被跟踪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am being followed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.08,0:17:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被谁跟踪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Followed, by whom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.71,0:17:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个骑单车的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A cyclist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.63,0:17:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每个星期六早晨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every Saturday morning{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.59,0:17:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我从农庄骑车到法恩罕车站\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I bicycle from the house to Farnham Station{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.43,0:17:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}搭12点22分的火车进城\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to catch the 12:22 to town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.60,0:17:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有段路程人烟稀少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is one very quiet and lonely stretch of road{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.02,0:17:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}路的一旁是查灵顿石南丛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that lies between Charlington Heath on the one hand{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.27,0:17:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}另一旁是查灵顿庄园树林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the woods of Charlington Hall on the other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.27,0:17:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两周前的今天 我经过那条路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two weeks ago today, I was passing this place{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.65,0:17:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}偶然回头时 见到一个男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when I chanced to look back and saw a man,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.91,0:18:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也骑着自行车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}also on a bicycle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.33,0:18:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}之后星期一回去时也见到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The following Monday when I returned he was there again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.46,0:18:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我明白了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.13,0:18:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上个星期六和星期一同样如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And again last Saturday, and again last Monday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.30,0:18:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你有跟你的雇主提过吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you mentioned this to your employer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.72,0:18:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}提过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.14,0:18:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卡拉瑟斯先生非常担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Carruthers was very concerned,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.47,0:18:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并订购了马和轻便马车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and has ordered a horse and trap{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.36,0:18:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这样我就不必独自上路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so that in the future I should not travel unaccompanied.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.23,0:18:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但他们还没到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But they've not yet arrived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.23,0:18:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今天早上呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this morning?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.52,0:18:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他又跟踪我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was following me again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.28,0:18:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我减速 他也减速\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I slowed down, but he did the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.08,0:18:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我停车 他也停车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I stopped completely, but he did the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.17,0:18:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此我心生一计来对付他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, I laid a trap for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.44,0:19:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这条路上有处急转弯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is a sharp turning of the road,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.23,0:19:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我快速转弯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I pedaled very quickly towards this{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.32,0:19:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后停车等着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then stopped and waited.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.70,0:19:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但他就这么凭空消失了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he seemed to disappear into thin air.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.25,0:19:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你能形容一下这名男子吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you describe this man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.91,0:19:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道你只远远见过他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I realize that you've only seen him from a distance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.15,0:19:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.71,0:19:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他穿着深色外衣 戴着深色眼镜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wears a dark suit, dark spectacles,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.96,0:19:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}蓄着络腮胡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he has a beard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.42,0:19:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}年不年轻？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Young, old?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.09,0:19:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大概是中年人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's about middle-aged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.76,0:19:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看看我有没有弄错地形\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, let me see if I have the geography correct.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.22,0:19:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是条路 这边有个急弯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here is the road, with a sharp bend in it here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.40,0:19:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这边是查灵顿石南丛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On this side, Charlington Heath,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.65,0:19:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}另一边是查灵顿庄园树林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and on the other, the woods of Charlington Hall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.53,0:20:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在弯道等了他多久？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long did you wait for him here around the bend?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.95,0:20:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不超过2分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no more than two minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.53,0:20:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此他不可能原路返回\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So he could not have retreated back down the road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.24,0:20:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}周围有岔路吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are there any side roads?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.79,0:20:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这段路没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}None along this stretch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.91,0:20:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会不会是往石南丛小路走了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could he have taken a footpath across the heath?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.50,0:20:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}石南丛十分平整荒芜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, the heath is totally flat and bleak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.08,0:20:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想如果那样我能看到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I would have noticed him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.25,0:20:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此 根据排除推理法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, by a process of exclusion,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.96,0:20:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}得出结论 他走进了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we arrive at the fact that he made his way towards{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.05,0:20:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}查灵顿庄园树林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charlington Hall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.89,0:20:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卡拉瑟斯先生如何谋生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now how does Mr. Carruthers make his living?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.60,0:20:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他非常富有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, he's a rich man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.97,0:20:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但却没有马车或马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But no carriages or horses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.02,0:20:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但起码他非常富裕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, at least he's very well off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.94,0:20:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他每周进城两三次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He goes into the city two or three times a week,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.48,0:20:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有时会提起他的金矿股票\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he sometimes refers to his gold shares.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.78,0:20:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我明白了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.91,0:20:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你必须马上告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must let me know immediately{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.24,0:20:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}任何新发现的情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if there are any fresh developments.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.62,0:20:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}眼下我非常忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am extremely busy just now,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.62,0:20:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我会抽空调查你的案子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I will find time to make inquiries into your case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.37,0:20:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.25,0:20:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}与此同时 不要没通知我就采取行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the meantime, take no step without letting me know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.13,0:21:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信我们会给你带来好消息的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure we shall have nothing but good news for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.10,0:21:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希望如此 华生医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do hope so, Dr. Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.82,0:21:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非常可爱的女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very lovely girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.36,0:21:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.53,0:21:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}根据自然规律\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it is part of the settled order of nature{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.70,0:21:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这样的女孩应该不乏追求者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that such a girl should have followers,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.49,0:21:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过没人会选荒僻村路骑车追求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but for choice, not on bicycles in lonely country roads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.91,0:21:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你真认为她身处险境吗 福尔摩斯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really think she may be in some danger, Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.33,0:21:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.50,0:21:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}接下来的星期一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the following Monday,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.50,0:21:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯因为工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes found that he had business{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.01,0:21:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而逗留伦敦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which detained him in London,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.17,0:21:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此他派我搭早班车前往法恩罕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so, he dispatched me on the early train to Farnham{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.89,0:21:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以便观察史密斯小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I might observe Miss Smith's passage{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.14,0:21:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}经过查灵顿庄园所走的路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}past Charlington Hall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.02,0:21:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那里正如她所描述的一般\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The setting was just as she had described,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.10,0:22:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}庄园被茂密的树林环绕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}heavily wooded on the side bordering the hall,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.19,0:22:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}路的另一边则一片荒芜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and utterly exposed on the other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.11,0:22:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我选好唯一的藏身处 等待着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I selected the only available cover, and waited.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.97,0:25:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生 你在浪费时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson, you have wasted your time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.80,0:25:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我以为我做得很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought I did rather well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.01,0:26:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 你的藏身处选得很糟糕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, your hiding place was ill-chosen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.31,0:26:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你应该藏在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should have been in the bracken{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.35,0:26:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}路另一边的灌木丛中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on the other side of the road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.23,0:26:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那样就可以近距离观察\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then that way you would have had a close view{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.40,0:26:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那位迷人的孤身骑车人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of this fascinating solitary cyclist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.36,0:26:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.36,0:26:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而你却藏在100码之外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As it is, you were a hundred yards away{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.61,0:26:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能告诉我的情况甚至比\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and can tell me even less{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.11,0:26:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上周六史密斯小姐说的还少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}than Miss Smith reported to us last Saturday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.61,0:26:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说他伏身在车把上？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You describe him as bending low over the handle bar?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.32,0:26:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 低伏着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, quite low.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.03,0:26:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}又是为了隐藏面目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thus concealment again,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.45,0:26:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对藏那么远的你来说很有效\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which in your case worked perfectly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.58,0:26:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你做得非常糟糕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh know, you really have done remarkably badly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.63,0:26:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他走进庄园\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He goes back to the Hall{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.80,0:26:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你却一路跑回伦敦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you come all the way back to London{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.61,0:26:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去找房屋经纪人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to call on a house agent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.80,0:26:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我查到了想要的信息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I found the information I was seeking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.97,0:26:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你找到个叫威廉森的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You found the name Williamson,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.27,0:26:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对我来说毫无用处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which conveys nothing to my mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.43,0:26:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们得知他年老以及正派\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, we know he's elderly and respectable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.14,0:26:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此 不可能是那位精力充沛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And therefore, unlikely to be the energetic cyclist{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.27,0:26:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能快速逃开矫健年轻女孩的骑车人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that sprints away from that athletic young girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.14,0:26:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我该怎么做？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, what should I have done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.39,0:26:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去最近的小酒馆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gone to the nearest public house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.15,0:26:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那儿是乡村流言蜚语的中心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is the center of country gossip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.44,0:26:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们会告诉你庄园内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They would have given you every name{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.82,0:26:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从主人到帮厨女佣的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from the master to the scullery maid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.86,0:26:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而不是你告诉我的… 威廉森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Instead of which, you give me... Williamson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.00,0:27:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从你的远行中我们得知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what have we gained by your expedition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.59,0:27:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那女孩所讲的是真事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fact that the girl's story is true;{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.46,0:27:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这我从未怀疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never doubted that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.26,0:27:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}骑车人和庄园有关联\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That there is a connection between the cyclist and the Hall;{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.51,0:27:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这我也从未怀疑过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never doubted that, either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.43,0:27:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}庄园租给一个叫威廉森的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Hall is tenanted by a man called Williamson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.68,0:27:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁敢保证就是他？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is the better for that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.06,0:27:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我明天就去小酒馆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shall go back tomorrow and visit the public house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.61,0:27:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不要草率行事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, my dear sir, do not commit yourself to rashness{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.86,0:27:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为你暂时很消沉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because you are temporarily depressed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.19,0:27:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}星期六前做任何事都是徒劳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can do nothing useful until Saturday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.99,0:27:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我真的做得很糟糕？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did I really do remarkably badly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.37,0:27:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.72,0:28:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非常美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.39,0:28:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 卡拉瑟斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Mr. Carruthers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.97,0:28:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是首新曲子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is a new piece.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.81,0:28:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我得多加练习\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to practice it more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.57,0:28:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不是指音乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I don't mean the music.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.49,0:28:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}维尔莉特 我有个问题想问你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Violet, I have a question to ask you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.79,0:28:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}早上好 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Morning, Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.59,0:28:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}维尔莉特·史密斯小姐的来信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A letter from Miss Violet Smith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.46,0:28:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卡拉瑟斯向她求婚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now Carruthers has proposed marriage to her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.01,0:28:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卡拉瑟斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carruthers!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.97,0:28:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}男士有求婚的权利 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentlemen are permitted to propose marriage, Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.60,0:28:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他一定不知道西里尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course he didn't know about Cyril.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.06,0:28:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要去法恩罕？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you going to Farnham?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.60,0:28:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想去验证我的一两个设想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to test one or two theories which I have formed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.52,0:28:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要一起去吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shall I come with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.77,0:29:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不用 那样既无用又多余\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, that will be neither useful nor necessary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.32,0:29:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去最近的小酒馆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try the nearest public house,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.82,0:29:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那儿是乡村流言蜚语的中心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}always a good center for country gossip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.37,0:29:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 华生 很好的提议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Watson, capital notion!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.07,0:30:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下午好 店主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, Good afternoon, Landlord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.36,0:30:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}麻烦能来半品脱当地啤酒吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I have half a pint of your local ale, please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.37,0:30:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然可以 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Certainly, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.37,0:30:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 给 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Here you are. - Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.88,0:30:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}零钱你留着吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You may keep the change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.55,0:30:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您非常慷慨 先生 但不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's most generous of you, sir, but I couldn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.47,0:30:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没理由接受您的慷慨给予\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I haven't done anything to warrant such generosity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.55,0:30:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我正打算给你一个理由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm about to give you the opportunity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.39,0:30:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我需要一些信息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need some information.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.64,0:30:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不爱瞎扯淡 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I'm not one for idle gossip, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.44,0:31:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也是 我更喜欢事实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neither am I, I prefer facts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.52,0:31:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟我谈谈查灵顿庄园的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me about the people at Charlington Hall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.48,0:31:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是指威廉森先生吗 先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean Mr. Williamson, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.15,0:31:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.24,0:31:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他… 他刚走不到五分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, he... he was in here not more than five minutes ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.18,0:31:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们错过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just missed him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.07,0:31:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟我说说这个威廉森先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me about Mr. Williamson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.20,0:31:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是位年老及正派的绅士吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is he an elderly, respectable gentleman?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.41,0:31:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他上年纪了 这毫无疑问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, he's elderly, no doubt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.04,0:31:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我决不会在背后说人坏话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Far be it from me to speak ill of people behind their backs,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.96,0:31:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我不确定他是否为人正派\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I'm none too sure about respectable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.04,0:31:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.96,0:31:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}据说他以前是位牧师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is an ex-clergymen, I reckon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.76,0:31:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以前？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ex?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.01,0:31:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}似乎是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apparently.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.18,0:31:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他被除名了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was struck off,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.30,0:31:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或什么牧师会有的处分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or whatever it is happens to clergymen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.55,0:31:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}医生才会被除名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's doctors that are struck off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.49,0:31:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟我说说庄园里的其他人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me about the other people up at the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.35,0:31:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们都是家仆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, they're just domestic staff,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.81,0:31:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都是虔诚的本地人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and they're all local and God-fearing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.94,0:31:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.15,0:31:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}周末总会有一帮人聚集在庄园\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He do have folk up there at weekends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.51,0:31:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 周末？- 是的 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Weekends? - Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.16,0:31:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}周末\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weekends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.62,0:32:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没问题 什么样的人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, no problem. What sort of folk?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.83,0:32:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}热情的一帮人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, they're a warm lot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.42,0:32:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}热情？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Warm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.42,0:32:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 热情得让人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, the sort you won't want to get too near{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.09,0:32:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不敢接近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for fear of getting burnt like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.84,0:32:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.84,0:32:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你也许认为好 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you may think it's good, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.22,0:32:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们和村里人相处得不太好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They don't come down well in the village, I can tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.79,0:32:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其中一个人尤为特别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was one fellow in particular.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.14,0:32:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}特别热情 是吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Particularly warm, is he, this fellow?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.48,0:32:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他非常特别 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is very particularly, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.61,0:32:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我打赌他蓄着红胡子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll wager he has a red mustache.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.74,0:32:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你认识他吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, do you know him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.91,0:32:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}素未谋面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never met the gentleman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.99,0:32:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你现在有机会了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, now is your chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.58,0:32:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伍德利先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Woodley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.33,0:32:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}关你屁事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}None of your damn business!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.63,0:32:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}店主开了如此体面的酒馆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our Landlord keeps a very respectable house,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.92,0:32:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是你撒泼的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and your language is not welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.59,0:32:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你以为你是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who do you think you are?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.67,0:32:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你跑来问东问西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell do you want{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.85,0:32:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到底想干什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}coming here asking all them questions?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.18,0:32:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说得很对 店主 他明显不是君子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're quite right, Landlord, clearly not a gentleman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.89,0:33:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}彼此彼此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I'm as much a gentleman as you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.03,0:33:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在场所有人证明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody here will bear witness to the fact{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.99,0:33:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是正当自卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I am acting in self-defense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.38,0:33:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卑鄙小人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Swine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.18,0:33:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 先生 是君子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, sir, a gentleman!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.01,0:33:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只有恶棍才会用手背打人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only a ruffian deals a blow with the back of a hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.72,0:33:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而君子 则用左直拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A gentleman uses the straight-left...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.43,0:33:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以先生 我是位君子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I, sir, am a gentleman!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.27,0:34:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有趣极了 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was absolutely delicious, Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.98,0:34:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看出来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.61,0:34:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}左直拳对抗乱舞的恶棍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A straight left against a slogging ruffian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.20,0:34:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我挂彩了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I emerged, as you see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.28,0:34:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}乱舞的恶棍呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the slogging ruffian?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.91,0:34:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伍德利先生用马车抬回去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Woodley was taken home in a cart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.76,0:35:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}又是那个可怕的男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's that horrible man again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.81,0:35:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哪个男人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.96,0:35:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我今天好像见到伍德利先生在花园里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought I saw Mr. Woodley in the garden today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.97,0:35:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 他住在这附近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You did. He's staying in the area.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.39,0:35:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但别担心 我郑重地告诫他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But do not worry, I have told him quite firmly{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.68,0:35:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再也不许踏进这座房子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he's not to set foot inside the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.40,0:35:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}"亲爱的福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Dear Mr. Holmes:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.23,0:35:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你一定已经料到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will not be surprised to learn{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.36,0:35:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我星期六将会辞去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I will be leaving{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.68,0:36:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卡拉瑟斯先生的那份工作"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Carruthers's employment on Saturday. "{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.95,0:36:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可恶的伍德利先生又出现在奇尔顿农庄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The odious Mr. Woodley has reappeared at Chiltern Grange.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.41,0:36:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但起码这次她不用骑车去车站了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, but at least she won't be bicycling to the station.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.67,0:36:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}终于 富有的卡拉瑟斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So finally, the rich Mr. Carruthers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.80,0:36:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}找到马和马车了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has acquired a horse and trap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.46,0:36:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}的确\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.46,0:36:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看这 "一切烦恼将在星期六烟消云散"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look here, "all my troubles will be over on Saturday. "{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.89,0:36:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}明天 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tomorrow, Holmes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.52,0:36:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她的一切烦恼将会烟消云散\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}all her troubles will be over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.89,0:36:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么我对那词感到不安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do I worry about that word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.64,0:36:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哪个词？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which word?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.48,0:36:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}"马车"(也有"陷阱"的意思)\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Trap."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.63,0:37:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 多么美好的早晨 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, what a splendid morning, Holmes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.80,0:37:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这个季节这天气尚算可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's acceptable weather for the time of year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.64,0:37:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁会在这么个早晨伤害那可爱的女孩？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now who would want to harm that dear girl on such a morning?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.56,0:37:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希望没人会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope nobody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.10,0:37:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你怎么带着左轮枪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So why did you bring your revolver?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.85,0:37:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我说的是希望 而不是推论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm talking about my hope, not my expectations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.86,0:38:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.61,0:38:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想那位是史密斯小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I fancy that is our Miss Smith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.99,0:38:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她肯定想赶更早一班车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She must be traveling by an earlier train.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.62,0:38:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只提前了半个小时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I give her a margin of half an hour,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.25,0:38:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但在我们会她前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but she'll be past Charlington Hall{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.28,0:38:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她肯定早经过查灵顿庄园了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before we can possibly meet her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.33,0:38:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那怎么办好？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what can we do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.59,0:38:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}用跑的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We could run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.34,0:38:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}笨蛋 我早该想到提前出发这点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fool, I should have allowed for that earlier train!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.04,0:38:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是绑架\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's abduction,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.04,0:39:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生 是绑架 谋杀 天知道怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson, it's abduction, murder, heaven knows what.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.38,0:39:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}截停那马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop that horse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.40,0:39:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.48,0:39:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快来 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Watson!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.49,0:39:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看看还能不能亡羊补牢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's see if I can repair the consequences of my own blunder!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.11,0:40:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Up there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.30,0:40:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.22,0:40:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们在哪找到的马车？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did you get that cart?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.39,0:40:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}维尔莉特·史密斯小姐在哪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is Miss Violet Smith?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.81,0:40:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这话该我问 这是她的马车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what I'm asking you. You were in her cart!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.73,0:40:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}马车在路上 上面一个人也没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was on the road, there was no one in it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.64,0:40:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}似乎有人从这里走过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody seems to have gone through this way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.78,0:40:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们得找到他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must find them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.99,0:40:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come, Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.00,0:41:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看 你认识他吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now look, do you know who this is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.34,0:41:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}彼得 马夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's Peter, the groom,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.46,0:41:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他送她上车站\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he was taking her to the station.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.30,0:41:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他还活着 脉搏很有力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's alive, his pulse is strong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.38,0:41:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}肯定是刚发生的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mustn't be left lying there too long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.84,0:41:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别管他 不用我们救他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let him lie, we can't do him any good,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.55,0:41:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我们可以从一个女人会遭受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but we might save her from the worst fate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.46,0:41:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}的最坏厄运中救出她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that can befall a woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.10,0:41:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你去哪儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.77,0:41:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大宅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The house!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.69,0:41:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们没去大宅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They didn't go to the house!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.10,0:41:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们走了左边这条路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They went this way to the left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.15,0:41:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你肯定？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.32,0:41:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卑鄙小人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, cowardly dogs!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.86,0:41:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 来不及了 - 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Too late! - Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.53,0:41:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们强来 来不及了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too late by the living Jingo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.92,0:41:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在上帝及其仆人的见证下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For as much as John and Violet{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.73,0:41:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}约翰和维尔莉特自愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}have consented together in holy wedlock,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.76,0:42:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}缔结神圣的夫妻关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and have witnessed the same before God and this company...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.53,0:42:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并且双方已经\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and have declared the same{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.23,0:42:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}交换戒指\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by the giving and receiving of a ring,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.82,0:42:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}携手终老\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the joining of hands,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.74,0:42:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我宣布 你们结为夫妻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I pronounce that they be man and wife, together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.87,0:42:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恭喜你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Congratulations!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.09,0:42:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 阿门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, amen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.46,0:42:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们结婚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're married!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.84,0:42:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}欢迎参加婚宴 先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to the party, gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.51,0:42:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}容我介绍伍德利太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me introduce you to Mrs. Woodley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.23,0:42:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要 卡拉瑟斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't Carruthers!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.02,0:42:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卡拉瑟斯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carruthers!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.36,0:43:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我要这姑娘安然无恙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, and I'll see this woman righted,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.78,0:43:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即使为此上绞架也在所不惜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if I have to swing for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.62,0:43:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太迟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're too late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.74,0:43:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她是我的妻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She is my wife!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.62,0:43:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 她是你的寡妻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, she's your widow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.29,0:43:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我说过 如果你再骚扰她 我会怎么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you what I'd do if you molested her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.25,0:43:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝为证 我言出必行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By the Lord, I'm a man of my word!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.18,0:43:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们雇我的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you hired me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.18,0:43:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可没说会发生这些乱七八糟的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}nobody told me there'd be any of this damn nonsense!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.14,0:43:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把枪放下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop that pistol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.64,0:43:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生 拣起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson, pick it up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.85,0:43:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把枪给我 不要再动武了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me that revolver, we'll have no more violence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.77,0:43:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是谁 在这指手画脚？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you to be giving these orders?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.19,0:43:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夏洛克·福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sherlock Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.65,0:43:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good Lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.45,0:43:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.07,0:43:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.82,0:43:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还能驾车到法恩罕吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you well enough to drive into Farnham?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.49,0:43:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 先生 我想可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir, I reckon I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.04,0:43:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把这张纸条\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then give this note{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.11,0:43:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}交给警察局局长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to the superintendent of the police station.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.63,0:43:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the meantime,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.38,0:43:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们都受我的监管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must detain you all under my own personal custody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.12,0:44:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}俩病人怎么样 医生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How are the patients, Doctor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.25,0:44:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}史密斯小姐很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss Smith's very well,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.33,0:44:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尽管受到如此恶劣的对待\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}considering the foul way she's been treated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.79,0:44:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伍德利呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Woodley?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.21,0:44:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}唉 他还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alas, I have no doubt he will live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.92,0:44:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么 那我上楼去结果他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, I'll go upstairs and finish him off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.05,0:44:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 坐下 卡拉瑟斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, sit down in that chair, Carruthers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.47,0:44:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.35,0:44:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他不值得我为他送死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He isn't worth swinging for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.35,0:44:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但难道那姑娘真的得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But do you tell me that girl{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.42,0:44:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一辈子受狂徒伍德利的束缚吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is to be tied to Roaring Jack Woodley for life?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.60,0:44:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}用不着你过问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You needn't concern yourself about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.19,0:44:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我主持了婚礼 他们至死不渝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I married them till death do them part.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.75,0:44:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她不可能成为他妻室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Under no circumstances can she be considered his wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.99,0:45:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你确定？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.61,0:45:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}原因有二\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For two very good reasons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.78,0:45:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}第一 我们完全可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the first place, we are very safe in{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.51,0:45:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}质疑威廉森先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}questioning Mr. Williamson's right{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.66,0:45:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}主持婚礼的资格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to solemnize a marriage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.20,0:45:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我受任过圣职\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have been ordained.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.87,0:45:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已被免去圣职\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And unfrocked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.25,0:45:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一朝为牧师 终身为牧师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once a clergyman, always a clergyman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.75,0:45:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不这么看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.42,0:45:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那结婚证呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about the license?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.93,0:45:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们有结婚证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, we had a license.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.60,0:45:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have it here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.60,0:45:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无疑是用不法手段取得的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Undoubtedly obtained by a trick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.94,0:45:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但无论如何 强迫的婚姻不是婚姻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, in any case, a forced marriage is no marriage,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.65,0:45:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而你会发现 这是一项重罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}indeed, it is a very serious felony, as you will discover.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.15,0:45:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在等警察的这段时间里 卡拉瑟斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, while we are waiting for the police, Mr. Carruthers,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.61,0:45:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说说你的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you might tell me your story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.24,0:45:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你把秘密捅出去 鲍·卡拉瑟斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you squeal on us, Bob Carruthers,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.46,0:45:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会像你对付杰克·伍德利那样对付你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll serve you as you served Jack Woodley!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.00,0:45:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不用瞎激动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no need for you to get over-excited.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.63,0:46:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事情再清楚不过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The case is clear enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.13,0:46:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}既然你那么清楚 为什么不由你来说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, if it's clear enough, why don't you tell us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.18,0:46:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.80,0:46:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卡拉瑟斯先生得适当补充细节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Carruthers will have to fill in a few details{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.18,0:46:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以满足我个人的好奇心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for my private curiosity,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.18,0:46:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我很乐意来讲述\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I am happy to do the talking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.98,0:46:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}首先\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the first place,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.90,0:46:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们三个从南非来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the three of you came across from South Africa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.98,0:46:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}错了 我从没去过南非\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wrong, I've never even been in South Africa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.07,0:46:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.53,0:46:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伍德利在我们回来后才找到这禽兽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Woodley acquired this creature after our return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.12,0:46:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很好 你和伍德利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very well, you and Woodley{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.71,0:46:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在南非结识了拉夫·史密斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}had known Ralph Smith in South Africa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.21,0:46:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们相信他将不久于人世\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You had reason to believe that he would not live long,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.13,0:46:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并发现他侄女将继承他的遗产\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you found out that his niece would inherit his fortune.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.76,0:46:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.84,0:46:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们却告诉她 她叔叔死时贫困交加\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you told the girl her uncle died in poverty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.88,0:46:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为他明显奄奄一息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, as he was still alive, admittedly only just,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.31,0:46:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想这有钱人没立下遗嘱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and a wealthy man who I suspect had made no will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.69,0:47:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拉夫·史密斯不认字也不会写\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ralph Smith could neither read nor write.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.02,0:47:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此你和伍德利回来寻找他侄女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, you and Woodley came over here and hunted up the girl,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.45,0:47:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}得知维尔莉特是他最亲的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}knowing she was the next of kin,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.53,0:47:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们可以分掉遗产\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and that you would share the plunder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.66,0:47:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}作为公证费 我也可以分得一份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was due a share for services rendered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.83,0:47:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而卡拉瑟斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Carruthers,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.17,0:47:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你却犯了个错误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you made the mistake{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.56,0:47:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爱上了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of falling in love with her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.47,0:47:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}生平第一次知道什么叫爱 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The first time that ever I knew what love was, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.01,0:47:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么你不告诉她她的危险处境？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why didn't you tell her of the danger she was in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.39,0:47:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.19,0:47:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为这样她会离开我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because she would have left me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.82,0:47:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我受不了这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I couldn't bear to face that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.87,0:47:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的女儿莎拉怎么办？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, what will happen to my daughter, Sarah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.25,0:48:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她会得到妥善照顾的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll see she's well taken care of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.30,0:48:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尽管她不会爱上我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see, even if she couldn't love me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.80,0:48:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但能在房子里见到她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it meant a great deal to see her about the house{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.92,0:48:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听到她的声音 我就知足了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and hear the sound of her voice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.27,0:48:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你称之为爱 卡拉瑟斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You may call it love, Mr. Carruthers,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.94,0:48:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我却称之为自私\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should call it selfishness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.32,0:48:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许两者是共存的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe the two things go together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.30,0:48:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我想保护她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I tried to protect her,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.70,0:48:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我从未让她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never once let her go past this house{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.25,0:48:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}独自经过这座\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where I knew those rascals were lurking{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.99,0:48:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}流氓潜伏的房子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}without following her on my bicycle{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.92,0:48:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会亲眼看着她不受伤害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to see she came to no harm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.67,0:48:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我保持距离并戴上假胡子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I kept my distance and wore that beard{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.71,0:48:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这样她就不会认出我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so she should not recognize me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.30,0:48:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后我想你收到了电报？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I presume the cable arrived?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.13,0:48:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}电报 什么电报？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cable, what cable?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.36,0:49:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}"老儿已死"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"THE OLD MAN IS DEAD."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.32,0:49:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哪个老儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What old man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.82,0:49:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想是在南非的拉夫·史密斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I imagine Ralph Smith in South Africa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.16,0:49:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.32,0:49:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但此时你和伍德利吵了一架\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But by this time you and Woodley had quarreled{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.16,0:49:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后他离开了农庄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he had left the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.83,0:49:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伍德利又来问我是否依原计划行事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Woodley came back again to ask me to stick to the bargain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.96,0:49:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我拒绝了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I refused.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.67,0:49:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我说我不会使用武力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said I would have nothing to do with violence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.59,0:49:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最后一个细节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One last detail,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.18,0:49:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么由伍德利来充当丈夫？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}why was Woodley chosen as the prospective husband?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.19,0:49:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这让我难以启齿…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am ashamed to say it...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.19,0:49:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们打牌 拿她做赌注\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we played cards for her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.06,0:50:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 我知道判决结果了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes, I have the results of the trial.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.82,0:50:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 法官总结说…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to this, the judge in summing up said...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.74,0:50:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.24,0:50:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生 我能否凭经验猜测？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson, may I be permitted an educated guess?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.50,0:50:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.46,0:50:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想伍德利会被判刑10年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would expect Woodley to get ten years,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.05,0:50:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}威廉森7年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Williamson seven years,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.13,0:50:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至于卡拉瑟斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Carruthers,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.80,0:50:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}鉴于审判时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in view of the eloquent speech{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.53,0:50:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我为他作的一番出色辩解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I made on his behalf at the trial,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.05,0:51:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大约6个月吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}probably six months.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.81,0:51:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}丝毫不差\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is exactly right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.77,0:51:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有些优势 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I have certain advantages, Watson,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.65,0:51:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大部分数据来源于更早出版的报纸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}largely the fact that I sent out for the early edition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.24,0:51:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}的确是优势\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An undoubted advantage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.36,0:51:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同时 我们收到了一份礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Also, we have received a present,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.20,0:51:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来自西里尔·莫尔顿夫妇的结婚蛋糕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}some wedding cake from Mr. and Mrs. Cyril Morton,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.20,0:51:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}随之附了一封信说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}together with a letter telling us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.88,0:51:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}莫尔顿太太早前在南非的叔叔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that Mrs. Morton has inherited a large sum of money{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.87,0:51:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拉夫·史密斯处继承了一大笔遗产\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from her uncle, Ralph Smith, formerly of South Africa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.30,0:51:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这对幸福的夫妇很乐意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The happy couple are thoroughly enjoying{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.80,0:51:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在其父亲服刑期间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}looking after young Sarah Carruthers,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.26,0:51:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}照顾莎拉·卡拉瑟斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}while her father is in custody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.22,0:51:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她的琴艺正不断进步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her piano playing is improving{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.18,0:51:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并且想学骑车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and she wants to take up bicycling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.68,0:51:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到处都过着美好的日子 不是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A splendid day all round, wouldn't you say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.81,0:51:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有更好的事要发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is more splendor yet to come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.15,0:51:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}更好的事 什么意思？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More splendor, what do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.15,0:51:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}仔细看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch carefully.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.16,0:52:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 我想起来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I remember,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.03,0:52:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将解决约翰·文森特·哈登先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the chemical reaction that will solve the mystery{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.20,0:52:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迫害事件中疑点的化学反应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}concerning the persecution of Mr. John Vincent Harden.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.83,0:52:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Precisely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.58,0:52:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在皇家科学博物馆泡了一个星期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've spent the entire week in the Imperial Science Museum{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.17,0:52:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想这就是答案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I think this is the answer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.95,0:52:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就是答案 福尔摩斯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that the answer, Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.75,0:52:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错 那就是答案 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, that is the answer, Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.58,0:52:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我再想想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, let me think.{\r}
